WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:02.419
What if our world
wasn't the only one

00:00:02.503 --> 00:00:04.922
where existence is absurd?

00:00:05.756 --> 00:00:08.467
Please refer to the danger menu
for tips on how not to die.

00:00:09.176 --> 00:00:10.636
Fight attendant:
If your seat is in the peril row,

00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:12.721
you must help us
take the machine apart.

00:00:13.055 --> 00:00:14.932
Your reward is more legroom.

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:17.184
One jitter liquid, please.

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:20.020
Would you like to jitter
for one, two, or five hours?

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:22.564
Describe your current
level of activity.

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:25.484
90 percent below average.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:27.194
Gimme that mild poison!

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:27.736
Woo!

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:28.779
One, two, three!

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:31.698
Server:
I’ll let you two talk

00:00:31.782 --> 00:00:33.825
while I go over here
and pretend not to listen.

00:00:33.909 --> 00:00:35.577
- Huh, irony.
- Is that irony?

00:00:35.661 --> 00:00:36.787
I’m never sure.

00:00:37.663 --> 00:00:40.791
This is the adventure
we live for!

00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:42.626
Tiny trash.

00:00:43.544 --> 00:00:45.212
Being:
The bad moments will pass.

00:00:45.295 --> 00:00:46.839
Even the good moments will pass.

00:00:46.922 --> 00:00:49.216
That’s what our existence
is all about.

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:51.677
Ow. You licked me
inside the mouth.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:54.721
This is disgusting,
and it’s perfect!

